ext-blue-400\">Example: ₹50K income → ₹5K max EMI</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"text-left mb-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-white/60 font-medium\">* All calculations are estimates for informational purposes only</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-col lg:flex-row gap-4 sm:gap-6 lg:gap-12 relative\"><div class=\"transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out w-full lg:w-1/2 lg:flex-shrink-0 space-y-4 sm:space-y-6 order-1 lg:order-1\"><div class=\"md-panel-elevated p-4\"><div class=\"transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"md-panel-elevated p-3 sm:p-4 lg:p-5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-blue-400\">Car Cost Details</h3><div class=\"h-px w-16 bg-white/30\"></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"space-y-10\"><div class=\"space-y-8\" role=\"form\" aria-label=\"Car details form\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4 lg:gap-6 relative\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><label for=\"car-price-input\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white\" style=\"line-height:1.5\">Car Price</label></div><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"absolute left-4 top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2 font-semibold text-white/70 z-10\">₹</span><input id=\"car-price-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full pl-8 pr-4 py-1.5 max-md:py-3 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-400 focus:border-transparent transition-all text-sm max-md:text-base bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 text-white placeholder-white/50 max-md:min-h-[48px]\" placeholder=\"Enter car price\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><div class=\"flex gap-1 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-shrink-0 min-h-[20px] max-md:min-h-[44px] px-1.5 max-md:px-3 py-0.5 max-md:py-2 