r justify-between mb-2\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-white flex items-center\"><span class=\"text-2xl mr-2\">💰</span><span class=\"text-green-400 text-3xl font-black mr-2\">20</span>% Down Payment</h4><span class=\"text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold bg-red-500/20 text-red-300 border border-red-400/30\">0.0<!-- -->%</span></div><p class=\"text-white/80 text-sm font-medium\">Pay at least 20% upfront to reduce loan amount and interest</p></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-white flex items-center\"><span class=\"text-2xl mr-2\">⏳</span><span class=\"text-orange-400 text-3xl font-black mr-2\">4</span> Years Max</h4><span class=\"text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold bg-green-500/20 text-green-300 border border-green-400/30\">0<!-- -->y</span></div><p class=\"text-white/80 text-sm font-medium\">Keep loan term ≤ 4 years to avoid excessive interest</p></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-white flex items-center\"><span class=\"text-2xl mr-2\">📊</span><span class=\"text-blue-400 text-3xl font-black mr-2\">10</span>% Income Max</h4><span class=\"text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold bg-green-500/20 text-green-300 border border-green-400/30\">0.0<!-- -->%</span></div><p class=\"text-white/80 text-sm font-medium\">Total transport costs should not exceed 10% of monthly income</p></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4\">🚗 How This Calculator Helps</h3><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-white mb-2\">📊 Complete Cost Visibility</h4><p class=\"text-white/70 text-sm\">See all costs including EMI, fuel, insurance, and processing fees in one place</p></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border 